        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Megan Fox, Shia LaBeouf, Kaley Cuoco, Sara Sugarman, Robert Shapiro, Matthew Hart, Stuart Gillard\n- Films: Confessions of a Teenage Drama Queen, Crimes of Fashion, Transformers\n- Companies: Walt Disney Pictures\n- Songs: Na Na\n\nFacts:\n- Confessions of a Teenage Drama Queen is a 2004 American teen musical comedy film directed by Sara Sugarman and produced by Robert Shapiro and Matthew Hart for Walt Disney Pictures.\n- Crimes of Fashion stars Kaley Cuoco and Megan Fox and was directed by Stuart Gillard.\n- The song Na Na appeared in the Disney film Confessions of a Teenage Drama Queen.\n- In 2007, Megan Fox co-starred as Mikaela Banes, the love interest of Shia LaBeouf's character, in the blockbuster action film Transformers, and the role became her breakout role.",
